  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tautai - Governance for Economic Growth for Samoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tautai - Governance for Economic Growth program for Samoa complements budget support by strengthening Samoa&apos;s institutions of government, promoting equitable economic growth and supporting improved fiscal efficiency that reduces the country&apos;s vulnerability to debt and external shocks. As a &apos;facility&apos; model program, it does this by partnering with Ministries and other agencies to deliver assistance to their priorities in a range of ways, including: major projects, technical assistance, small grants, training and capacity development, and enabling twinning arrangements with Australia institutions. Assistance includes support towards Samoa&apos;s Joint Policy Action Matrix (JPAM) items, which reinforces effectiveness of our Budget Support investment.</narrative>
  </description>
